[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-hillbilly 4...Nf6"]
[Name "Hillbilly: 5.Nc3"]

5. Nc3 { Develops and hits d5. }
5... Nc6 { Develops. The pawn on d5 is safe: the knight on f6 and the queen guard it, and the knight on c6 looks at d4. }
6. d4 Bg4 { The rule of the opening. }
7. f3 Bd7 { Steps back: on d7 the bishop covers b5 and stops the knight on c3 from jumping in. } *
